    <name>Android Emoji</name>
    <summary>Emoji font released by Google</summary>
    <description>
      <p>The Android Emoji typeface contains a number of pictographs and smileys, popularly used in instant messages and chat forums.  The style of the typeface is playful.  It is taken from Google's Android Jelly Bean mobile phone operating system.</p>
      <p>This font hasn’t been updated since 2012.  You may well be better served by its replacement, Noto Emoji.</p>
